OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny overnight mist or fog
OL,6,Fclearing this morning. Otherwise it
OL,7,Fwill be a dry day with variable
OL,8,Famounts of cloud and a few sunny
OL,9,Fintervals. Light northeasterly wind.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry and
OL,12,Fpartly cloudy. Then the rest of the
OL,13,Fnight will be dry with variable
OL,14,Famounts of cloud. Frost and fog where
OL,15,Fskies remain clear.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FMainly dry although rather
OL,18,Fcloudy at times. Chance of one or two
OL,19,Flight showers, mainly in the south and
OL,20,Feast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
